Package: crispy-doom
Version: @DEB_CRISPY_DOOM_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Games
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://fabiangreffrath.github.io/crispy-doom/
Depends: xios-sdl2, libsdl2-mixer-2.0-0, libpng16-16
Recommends: freedoom
Description: Crispy Doom source port for Xios
 The limit-removing, enhanced-resolution Doom source port that stays faithful
 to the original game, built as a normal Xios Wayland application with SDL2
 video on OpenGL ES, PulseAudio sound effects, and OPL-emulated music.
 .
 Doom needs game data (an IWAD). Install freedoom for the free Freedoom: Phase
 1 and Phase 2, or copy your own doom.wad or doom2.wad into
 /var/jb/usr/share/games/doom.
